<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuel tapa Joel kungah Mangpa thu ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou upate aw, tam thu za un, Tualeh gamsunga tengte zousie in bildaw in ngai un! Noute khanlai leh na pu na pate uh, khanlai nangawn in tambang ana um kha, ngai mawngmawng tai mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na tate uh kungah tam thu hil unlen, na tate un atate u’kungah hil sawn u’henlen, atate un khangsawnte kungah hilsawn u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Singnget khauphete nehmawh teng khauphe hon in ane a, Khauphehon nehmawh teng atawnkawi khauphete in ane a, atawnkawi khauphete nehmawh teng, asugam khauphete in ane beita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nou zukhamte aw, khanglou unlen kap un, zudawn mite zousie aw, na kam ua kipat zu tha akilahmangtah zieh in, kap in mau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nam khat in ka gam ang dou ua, ahat a, atamdan uh simseng lou ahi a, aha uh humpibahnei ha bang ahi a, humpibahnei ginhuoitah hapi bang anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman ka grepgui asusegamta a, Ka theipi kungte asusie a, ahaw zousie akhoh sieng kilkel a, apaimangta hi, abate angiet ngou siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nungah siengthou akhangdawnlai pasal suun a, sai ip puon sil bangin kap in mau un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ann sillat leh dawn sillatte khu, Mangpa inn apat suhbei ahita hi. Mangpa nasem, siempute kap in amau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Loute suhsiet ahita a, gam sungin asuun hi; bute suhsiet ahitah zieh in, uain thate akangta a, sathau a gina ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou lounei mite zum unlen, nou grep huon bawlmite kap in mau un, aziehpen lou a mang bu leh, Barli bu lah ding a um nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grepguite agaw siengta a, Theipikungte avuoi siengta a, Kawlbuthei kungte, tum singte leh apple thei kungte zong, tualeh lou lai a theikung zousie zong avul siengta hi. Mihing tapate lah a kipat lungnopna zousie adaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou siempute aw, na kawng uh gah unlen, kap unlen suun un; Nou maitam nasemte aw, Kap in mau un, Nou ka Pasian nasemte aw hing pei unlen, zankhovah in sai ip puon sil in lum un, aziehpen ann sillatte leh, dawn sillatte na Pasian uh inn apat khaam ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ann ngawlna siensuo unlen, Khawmpi siengthou bawl un; Upate leh gam sunga teng zousie, Mangpa na Pasian uh inn ah kikhawm unlen, Mangpa kungah kikoukhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh kadei! tua ni khu a tung agih hi! Aziehpen Mangpa ni anaita; Bangkimbawltheipa akipat suhmangthaina bangin, ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I mitmu uapat ann neh ding lahmang hitalou ahiei mah? Lungnopna leh kipahna i Pasian uh, inn apat lahmang hitalou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Haichite leikhal nuoi ah agawta a, bupangte lah ahawm siengta bu atun nawnlou ziehin, bu innte ase siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gantate hathum hina mai uh e, Ganhonte chimaw in amangbangta uh, louhing mun aumlou zieh in belamhonte, nangawn athang gawpta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Mangpa nangma kungah ka kikou hi, aziehpen gamdai louhing munte akatumta a, meikuongin gamlah sing zousie akatumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamlah a saten zong nang a hing han uhi, luita tuite akangta a, gantatna mun louhingte akahtum siengtah zieh in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut unlen, Ka muol siengthou ah patau dah gingsah un, Gamsunga tengte zousie chitun u’heh, Aziehpen Mangpa ni hing tung ding ahita, hing tung pai ding ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mielna leh khonimna ni, meilum zin ni leh miel nasat ni, zingmawng meilum in muolte atuom bangin, mipi tamtah leh thahattah ahing pei dinga, tambang mawngmawng aumkha ngai nai sih a, anua chieng leh khang tampi nua chieng in zong, a um kia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amasang uah mei in akatum a, anualang uah meikuong in akaa hi; amasang uah gam khu Eden huon bang ahi a, anua uh gamdai suhsietsa bang ahi; Bangmain amauh asuohtasah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amel latdan uh sakol mel bang ahi ua, Sakol tungtuongmi bangin atai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kangtalai ging husa bangin muolvumte ah akitawm uhi, Meikuongin hampa gaw akaah ging bangin, kidou dinga mansa galkap hon bangin akiguol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amasang uah mipite apatau ua, amaitang zousie uh amuolta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihatte bangin atai ding ua, galdou mite bangin bang dawn ah akal ding uhi; michin mailam nawt in apei chiet ua, lampam a piel a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute khat leh khat kiphutuo lou in michin amauh mailam chiet ah apei uhi. Thaltang kaal a alut chieng un zong, khawl lou in apeisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khopi sungah asuh tai atou tai ua, kulpi bang tungah atai kawi ua, inn tungah akaltou ua, guta bangin kotta ah alut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute mai ah lei akiling a, vante achitun uhi; Ni leh ha amiel a, Aasite zong ataang nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa’n agalkap honte mai ah a aw asuo a, agiehphuol khu athupi mama ngal a, Athupieh sutangtungte athahat uhi. Mangpa ni khu athupi mama a, achizat huoi hi, Koi in athuoh zou diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin “Tuin Mangpa’n, “A lungtang zousie u’toh ann ngawlna toh Kap pumin, ka kungah hing kinuale kia un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na puonsilte uh hilou in, na lungtangte uh botkeh unlen,” Mangpa na Pasian kungah hing kinuale un. Ama khotuona leh hepina adim lungthah bailou, hepina lientah nei, sietna tunlou dinga lunghei zelpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh kunga, Na ann sillatte leh dawn sillalte u’zong, Ama hing kiheikia in, lungsim hengin, guolzawlna ahing nuasie sih ding chi koi in athei ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut unlen, Ann ngawlna siengthou phuong unlen, Khawmpi siengthou bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipite hankhawm unlen, mipi kikhawmte susiengthou un, upate hankhawm unlen, Naupangte leh naungeh nawitep laite puikhawm un, Mouneipa apindan apat pawtdoh henlen, Mounu zong akizepna pindan apat in hing pawtdoh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa nasem siempute khu innhim leh, maitam kikaal ah kap u’henlen, “Amauten Aw Mangpa na mipite khawi in, tualeh na goutante simmaw a um a, atung ua Pasian theilou namten, avaihawmkhum ding un na goutante pe vawt sin. Bangzieh a amaun namte lah a, A Pasian uh hei a um ahiei,” chi sese ding ahi uoi? Chi uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n agam thangsetah in akihuhpi ding a, tualeh amite alainat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mangpa’n adawng dinga, amite kungah, “Ngai un, bu leh uoin tha leh sathau ka hing pe ding hi. Taitah leh gilva tahin na um ding ua, namte lah ah simmaw in ka hing umsah nawnsih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Mallam galkap honte noute apat, gamlapi ah ka notmang ding a, Gamdai gamgaw leh gamse lah ah, amasalamte suolam tuipi ah alut dinga, anukhia lamte tumlam tuipi ah ka notlut ding a, A silbawl thupitahte ziehin, agim namsie ahing zamtou ding a, a ui gimnamsie akiza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Gam aw, zau sin, Mangpa’n sil thupitah abawltaah ziehin kipah in thanuom in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nou gamlah a gamsate zaunawn sih un, gamdai hampahing munte ahing seldohta hi; singte’n ga asuongta ua, theipi kung leh grepguiten zong gahoitah asuongta uhi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nou Zion tate kipah un, tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uah nuom un, aziehpen Aman noute guo masa ginumtah in ahing zusahta hi. Aman nou adingin guo ahing zu sah dinga, aha khatna ah guo masa leh, guo nukhia ahing zusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Buphuol khu bu in adim dinga, tualeh um leh belte khu uoin leh, sathau in adimlet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Keima’n na lah ua ka hing sawl, ka galkap hon thupitah Pettan khauphete, akitawnkawi khauphete leh asugam khauphete in, anehbei kumte ka hing nua dit kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nouten niengtah leh taitah in na ne ding ua, tualeh lamdangtah a noute a dinga hing bawlpiehpa, Mangpa na Pasian uh min na phatta ding uhi. Tualeh ka mite a zala ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei Israelte lah ah ka um chi leh, kei khu Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi a, Pasian dang mawngmawng a um sih chi na thei ding uhi. Ka mite azala ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuami nua chiengin mi zousie tungah, Ka Hagau ka sungbaw dinga, na tapate uleh na tanute un thu agenlawh ding ua, na putehte un mang aman ding ua, na tangvalte un mengmuna amu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ka suohpate leh ka suohnute tungah zong, ka hagau ka sungbaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Van tungah leh lei lam ah, sillamdang ka langsah dinga, sisan, meikuong leh meikhutung ka musah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ni amiel ding a hapi sisan asuoh ding hi. Mangpa ni thupitah leh chizat huoitah, atun masangin tam silte atung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahi dinga, Mangpa min lou pouma hundam ahi ding hi. Aziehpen Mangpa’n agensa bangin, Zion muol tung leh Jerusalem ah, asuohta umsunte lah a kipat Mangpa’n ahat ding umsunte lah ah, hutkhietna a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai un, tua nite leh hun a, Juda leh Jerusalem saltangte, ka puikia hun chieng in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam zousie zong ka khawm dinga, amaute Jehoshaphat phaiguom ah ka zawpisuh dinga, ka gam ahawmzah ua, namte lah a athezah uh ka mite leh, ka goutan Israelte ziehin, tua mun ah amaute tungah thukhenna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun ka mite adingin ai asan ua, pasal naupangte numei kizuate leina’n anei ua, Zu adawn theina dingun, numei naupangte zu man dingin azua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, nou Tai-ar, Sidon leh tuipi gei Philistin gam zousiete aw, Ka tungah bang bawl ding nahi uoi? Ka tunga hing thuh ding nahi uoi mah? Na hing thuh ua ahileh na hing thuhna u’khu, kintah leh gangtah in na tung uah ka hing thuh kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen nouten ka dangka, leh ka sana, tualeh ka van manpha tahtahte na pomang ua, na bieh inn sungte uah na kipuoh lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Juda mite leh Jerusalem mite zong agamgi ua kipat a, gamlapi a na hepmang theina ding un, Greek mite kungah na zuata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai un, amaute na zuana munte ua kipat in ka tohthou dinga, na thuhna bangbang un nouma lutung ngei ah, ahing lethuh kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tapate u’leh na tanute uh, Juda mite khut ah ka zua dinga, tualeh amauten amahaw gamlapi a um, Sabean mite kungah azuasawn ding uhi, chia Mangpa’n agensa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namte lah ah tami phuongzah un: Galdou dingin kisa un! Mihatte phawng unlen, galdou mi zousie hing kikhawm u’henlen, hing peitou u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na louhawna tute uh namsauin kheng unlen, na grepgui heusiengna siakuoikate uh teipi in kheng un. “Athazawngkhal in zong ka hat ahi, chi uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hing kikhawm unlen, hing kuon un, akimvel a um nam zousiete hing kikhawm khawm un, khum mun ah na mihatte hing peisuh sah in, Aw Mangpa!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Namte khanglou u’henlen, Jehoshaphat phaiguom ah hing peitou u’heh; Kei tua mun ah ka tou dinga, akim avel ua namte tungah vaihawmna bawl ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawite keng un, bu lah ding aminta hi hing pei unlen, kuon suh un, grep suhna kuong adimta, greptui belte adimletta hi agitlouna uh athupi sengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihonpite, thukhentatna phaiguom a um mihonpite, thukhentatna phaiguom ah, Mangpa ni khu thukhentatna phaiguom ah. Anai mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni leh hapi amiel dinga, aasite ataang nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zion akipat Mangpa ahawh dinga, Jerusalem apat A aw asuo ding a, lei leh vante akithing ding hi, hinanleh Mangpa khu amite kibutna ahi dinga, Israel tate thahatna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tuachi’n Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh, Ka muol siengthou Zion a teng ka hi chi, na thei ding uhi. Tuachi’n Jerusalem asiengthouta dinga, Tualeh gamdang mite koima asungah, apeisuoh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin muolten uoin tha atakhesahta dinga, Muolte khu nawitui in aluongta ding hi. Juda gam luite ah tui aluonglet ta dinga, Mangpa in akipat tuinah khat ahing pawtkhe ding a, Shittim phaikuom atapnou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Izipt akisegawp dinga, Edom khu gamdai kisesa asuoh ding hi aziehpen Juda mite tunga atatsiet ziehun, agam sung ua mawna neiloute sisan, asuo zieh uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda gam khu kumtawn in a umden dinga, Jerusalem khu akhang akhangin a umden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sisan khelna uh ka suhsieng loute, ka susieng ding hi; Mangpa Zion a aten zieh in.”
  </para>
</usx>
